      "writtenOn": "2022-08-25T06:14:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s right. We can measure the current time in this function as well. \n\nHowever the difference of two options is, including time period of creating VM or not. What I wrote includes the time period for creating VM, but the idea you suggested excludes such period.\n\nHow do you think about it?",
