        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-25T11:32:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The time between the creation of a VM and the run of the VM can be arbitrary; it could be hours or even days. I think we are more interested in the time span between the \"run (or start)\" of a VM and the exit.\n\nIn that sense, I think recording the time in this construction is too early. We should record it when start() is called.",
      "parentUuid": "fe188af2_3d745587",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 210,
        "endChar": 42
      },
